  "description": "Tracer Edge Freestyle BMX Bike – 20” Wheels, Hi-Ten Steel Frame, Perfect for Beginners to Pros in Vibrant Colors\n\n【EASIER RIDING】The TRACER BMX series is a great entry level complete that works well on the street, dirt, park and anywhere. They’re great for kids due to their small wheel size, but they’re also a lot of fun for taller riders and adults.\n【SAFER RIDING】Aluminum U-brake and brake levers provide precision speed control, with Hi-Ten steel. DRIVER: 9T, TIRES: 20 x 2.3\", BRAKE LEVER: Alloy Stealth, BRAKES: Alloy Cease U-brake.\n【HIGH QUALITY】High quality sealed ISO bottom bracket with CrMo square axle and bearing shells of wrought iron.\n【STRONGER DESIGN】The frame is made from strong Hi-Ten steel to give you reliable support and long-lasting comfort and is perfect for the street, park or trails. The wheels set features 20” x 2.3” tires mounted on aluminum single wall 36H rims.\n【EASY INSTALLATION】 Fits riders from 5 feet to 6 feet 2 inches tall; comes 85 percent assembled.\n\nCOLORS\nBlack, Blue, Matte Black, Matte Grey, Matte Green, Matte Red, Pear Green, Red\n\nSADDLE\nExtra padding and wide shell for maximum comfort\n\nCOLORS\nBlack, Blue, Matte Black, Pear Green, Red\n\nSADDLE\nExtra padding and wide shell for maximum comfort\n\nBOTTOM BRACKET\n\nBMX Cranks set Bottom Bracket Cr-Mo axle 8T-19MM\n\nREAR HUB\nAlloy Cartridge bearings 14mm Axle Cassette-type 9T",
